  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Putting the Principles for Digital Development into Practice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIAL aims to advance digital inclusion to achieve the SDGs, and is particularly committed to SDG 17 (Partnership for the Goals) by acting as a convener in the digital ecosystem and as the steward of the Principles for Digital Development. In addition, This project also aims to contribute towards SDG 9c (Significantly increase access to information and communications technology) through putting the Principles for Digital Development into practice</narrative>
  </description>
